Z||000002||theogre||12-13-2001||08:27 PM||||If you mean the rubber craddle bushings....<P><A HREF="http://www.suspension.com/" TARGET=_blank>Suspension Restoration Parts Co.</A> has polyurethane ones at reasonable prices. They are strongly recomended. Them or solid ones. You don't want rubber ones again.<P>There are notes about them in my cave. (Link at top of page)<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
